{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-06-09 09:05:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL PLATTS GLOBAL ENERGY AWARDS NOW ACCEPTING NOMINATIONS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NOMINATIONS ARE NOW BEING ACCEPTED FOR THE 2021 S&P GLOBAL PLATTS GLOBAL ENERGY AWARDS , WHICH RECOGNIZE CORPORATE AND INDIVIDUAL ACHIEVEMENTS IN NINETEEN AWARD CATEGORIES. THE AWARDS PROGRAM, OFTEN DESCRIBED AS "THE OSCARS OF ENERGY," IN ACCORDANCE WITH EASED COVID-19 RESTRICTIONS IN THE US WILL BE HELD IN-PERSON THIS YEAR AT CIPRIANI WALL STREET, NEW YORK, NY.'}